# Store the deployer key securely using Hardhat vars:
#   npx hardhat vars set DEPLOYER_KEY
#
# Key is encrypted at rest in ~/.config/hardhat/vars.json
# No .env file needed for the private key.
#
# Optional env overrides for deploy scripts:
# WSTRAX_ADDRESS=0x57402359Eb6f3aB02c19EA7B98F366f324b66Aae
# FACTORY_ADDRESS=0x...
# MULTICALL_ADDRESS=0x...
